        1436,
        1977,
        1683
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "I. In order to formulate plans to cope with the existing water shortage and to provide for additional sources of water supply to meet the needs of the City in the future, one necessary step is the measurement of the amounts of water consumed by the various categories of facilities. In line with this objective:",
      "logprob_stats": {
