    {
      "bbox": [
        341,
        1721,
        2030,
        1912
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "a. All mayoral agencies are directed to have water meters installed as promptly as possible on all mains leading into City-owned public buildings, including hospitals, office buildings, garages and park installations.",
